{"title":"2023 WSMO Tiebreaker Round Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_WSMO_Tiebreaker_Round_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the number of factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b654eeacdbdf3417c3e5f3d5ae169efbc9e7a5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24 ^ {6} - 20 ^ {6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_WSMO_Tiebreaker_Round_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2023 WSMO Tiebreaker Round Problems/Problem 1\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_WSMO_Tiebreaker_Round_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9ca2c163c6068a048fac01490ca11576c672be1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+y^3=76895$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff8cad1f68dea317b126dceae2fba41b534c842b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=65$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_WSMO_Tiebreaker_Round_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 WSMO Tiebreaker Round Problems/Problem 2\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_WSMO_Tiebreaker_Round_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the set of all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> such that the area of a triangle with side lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/5/94560ce65417cdcd8b607fad651edb1b252a970d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{x\\in S}\\left(x^2\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -24px\" width=\"65\" height=\"44\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_WSMO_Tiebreaker_Round_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 WSMO Tiebreaker Round Problems/Problem 3\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017103002\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 58/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2118/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:31891:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017103002 and revision id 274658. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}